. di "===== extended missing ordering ====="
===== extended missing ordering =====

. clear

. set obs 8
Number of observations (_N) was 0, now 8.

. gen double x = .
(8 missing values generated)

. replace x = 1      in 1
(1 real change made)

. replace x = 100    in 2
(1 real change made)

. replace x = -50    in 3
(1 real change made)

. replace x = .      in 4
(0 real changes made)

. replace x = .a     in 5
(1 real change made, 1 to missing)

. replace x = .b     in 6
(1 real change made, 1 to missing)

. replace x = .z     in 7
(1 real change made, 1 to missing)

. replace x = 0      in 8
(1 real change made)

. list x

     +-----+
     |   x |
     |-----|
  1. |   1 |
  2. | 100 |
  3. | -50 |
  4. |   . |
  5. |  .a |
     |-----|
  6. |  .b |
  7. |  .z |
  8. |   0 |
     +-----+

